  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet shatters the bony orbit of one eye. The squishy eyeball in its path is simply obliterated.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). You lose the eye – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.weczkAMPlTjX7lqU]{Amputation (Challenging)}. You must also pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound} in the ruin that was your peeper. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Easy)</strong> is required for Extraction.</p>"
    },
